# Production cutover governance

Read the **live** plan `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-28-production-cutover-mvp.md` plus the **open milestone section** — not the frozen archive.

Frozen history (default **off**): `docs/superpowers/plans/archive/2026-08-28-production-cutover-mvp.full.md`. Read it only to reconstruct a past decision or `PLAN REVISION`. If archive and live plan disagree, the live plan wins for execution.

The live plan is Alembic + cutover execution authority (slim 2026-09-01). M0–M5, **M6.1** (T1–T3), and **M6.2** (T4 / G8 PASS) are done. M1-T4 (staging-host Caddy) is cancelled. Open = **M6-T5**. `rehearsal_bot` may stay polling on the test token. P1 SATISFIED.

**Named-start:** a new chat may run MVP/cutover tasks only if the user message names a task ID or says **ادامه** / **شروع M6** (or the current open milestone). Greeting, status, or “what is next?” is not named-start — report the next pointer and stop. `ادامه` cannot cross a STOP class (M6-T5 is user-visible + high risk).

**STOP (do not start the next task):** user-visible; missing P2; weight 13/21; DNS/token/writer-freeze/M8; test fail / `PLAN REVISION`; checkpoint end (after M6-T4 stop before T5). Do not ask rubber-stamp `تایید` on Agent-only PASS. Do not auto-start M8 from a next-pointer.

