## 6. Alembic (graft — binding)

Production bot DB is remnabot-lineage **`0103`**. remnabot1 **live graph after M4-T3** is remnabot **`0111`** (remnawave_id + boot extras; revises grafted `0104`). Rehearsal G1 restore (`rehearsal_bot_pg15`) is **`0111`** with G6 backfill (`subscriptions.remnawave_id` 3170/3173). Models match `0111` identity/extras (M4-T4). `persist_identity` writes panel numeric `.id` (M4-T5). Upstream `0088–0110` lives only under `docs/superpowers/reference/upstream-alembic-0088-0110/`.

**Required next:** M6-T5 e2e RC smoke (named-start; G8 PASS). Do not copy archived upstream files back into `versions/`. Do not commit a full autogenerate revision.

**§18.1 cutover exception:** grafting remnabot `0088–0104` is authorized. “Never reuse donor revision IDs” forbids copying **upstream `/opt/bot`** migrations onto production data — not production-lineage recovery.

**Fallback:** if M4-T0 fails → `PLAN REVISION REQUIRED: Alembic graft failed M4-T0` (re-ID from `0103` only).

